# Bike Sales Analysis Dashboard

An interactive Excel dashboard designed to explore bike purchasing patterns across different customer demographics and commuting habits.

The project uses data cleaning, PivotTables, PivotCharts, and interactive slicers to analyze average income by gender and purchase status, bike purchases across age groups, and customer commuting distances.

**Tools & Skills**
- Microsoft Excel
- Data Cleaning and Transformation
- PivotTables and PivotCharts
- Interactive Slicers and Filtering
- Data Visualization and Dashboard Design

**Objective:** Turn raw customer data into an interactive dashboard that makes purchasing patterns easier to explore and understand.
